From: bornaradusin <bornaradusin@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 22:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 82/82] PC5: the pointer hides when the player hasn't used it for a
 while (Wine patch 0999)

A game played with the controller that leaves the Windows cursor on
showed the pointer, still, in a corner. The pointer now hides once it
hasn't been moved or clicked for 5 seconds and shows again at the next
move or click (WINE_PS5_CURSOR_IDLE_MS, 0 never hides it).
